From: Ivory <contact@ivory.cafe>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 16:36:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/32] Make repaired runs deliverable from ordinary adb

Select the newest artifact-bearing run, pull it atomically, invoke the ART repairer per process, summarize actionable partial reasons, and package raw evidence plus repaired outputs into a checksummed ZIP.

Constraint: The final artifact must be a ZIP readable through ordinary adb shell without adb root.
Rejected: Manager-app parsing or a privileged export service | host tooling keeps repair outside the production UI and preserves raw runs
Confidence: high
Scope-risk: narrow
Directive: Keep exports non-overwriting, raw-preserving, path-confined, and atomically packaged.
Tested: 7 exporter tests; Manager source contracts; real Coolapk export produced a valid 1219-member ZIP with 302 codeitems backfilled
Not-tested: JADX validation was not run
